---
---
<footer style="border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border); padding: 3rem 1.25rem; margin-top: auto; background: #fafafa;">
  <div style="max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2rem;">
    
    <!-- Top Row: Brand + Text Links -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem;">
      
      <!-- Brand / Bio -->
      <div style="max-width: 400px;">
        <a href="/" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="Axomiya Indie" style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover;" />
          <span style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main);">Axomiya Indie</span>
        </a>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          <span class="en-text">Using AI and technology to ensure every mind in Assam has equal access to knowledge.</span>
          <span class="as-text">AI আৰু টেকৰ জৰিয়তে অসমত সকলোলৈ সমানভাৱে তথ্য পোহৰাবলৈ কাম কৰি আছোঁ।</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Socials Column -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <h4 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 1rem;">Socials</h4>
        <a href="https://github.com/axomiyaindie" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-muted)'">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/axomiyaindie/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-muted)'">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://x.com/AxomiyaIndie" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-muted)'">X (Twitter)</a>
      </div>

      <!-- More Column (includes About) -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem;">
        <h4 style="margin: 0; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 1rem;">More</h4>
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@axomiyaindie" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-muted)'">YouTube</a>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/AxomiyaIndie" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-muted)'">Facebook</a>
        <a href="/about" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='var(--accent)'" onmouseout="this.style.color='var(--text-muted)'">About</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar: Copyright Only -->
    <div style="border-top: 1px solid var(--card-border); padding-top: 1.5rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
      <span>© 2026 Axomiya Indie. All rights reserved.</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>